                "/api/artifacts/app/versions/1/mirrors",
                new HttpEntity<>(mirrorBody(mirror("m2", 1)), jsonHeaders(rid)), JsonNode.class);
        assertThat(conflict.getStatusCode()).isEqualTo(HttpStatus.CONFLICT);
    }

